{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Geet gata hun [A]mai gungunata hun mai
[F#]Maine hasne ka [Bm]vaada kiya tha kabhi
[A]Isliye [Em]ab sada [A]muskurata [Bm]hoon main
[Bm]Yeh mohabbat [Em]ke pal [Bm]kitne anmol hai
[Bm]Kitne phoolon se [F#]nazuk mere bol hai
[F#]Sab ko phulon ki [Bm]mala pehnata hun mai
[Em]Muskurata [Bm]hoon main
[Bm]Roshni hogi [Em]itni kise [Bm]thi khabar
